    "note": "Senate Judiciary engrossed, 2019-02-14. Section 1 (SDCL 22-14-22) defines 'state capitol'; Section 4 (22-14-25) and Section 6 (22-14-28, county waiver limited to courthouses) also amended. Senate Do Pass Amended vote 20-13 on 2019-02-20; later amendments are not in the text read."
